            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Christopher Sides",
                        "email": "christopher.sides@hpe.com",
                        "username": "csides-hpe"
                    },
                    "message": "Goes with this PR that enables entity-manager to setup cooling/cooled_by associations as called out in EMConfigs.\n\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/82408\n\nI think I'm about 95% of the way to 'something that makes sense' but will definitely be hitting Discord in the next few days to ask for help in making sure I've organized things in a way that actually makes sense."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Christopher Sides",
                        "email": "christopher.sides@hpe.com",
                        "username": "csides-hpe"
                    },
                    "message": "Also note that the 'tachless fan support' PR ancestor is not required for this PR to work -- it was just easier for me to do testing this way, since the HPE systems I have to test with all use tachless fans.\n\nIf we decide we want the cooling/cooled_by associations and have to hold up on the tachless support, I'll be happy to separate things out then."
                }
            ],
